  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lesotho Health Sector Reform Project Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the Phase II of the Program (the Project) is to increase access to, and quality delivery of, essential health services. This development objective is aligned with the overall goal of the health sector reform program to achieve a sustainable increase in access to quality preventive, curative and rehabilitative health services and achievement of the Millennium Development Goals (MDGs).</narrative>
  </description>
